{"step_index":690,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T23:15:47Z","content":"The **Canonical Maximalist Typikon Digest Standard** is now permanently codified in the repository reference library.\n\n---\n\n### Codification Details\n\n1. **New Authoritative Reference File**:\n   * Created [.agents/references/canonical_maximalist_digest_standard.md](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/.agents/references/canonical_maximalist_digest_standard.md).\n   * Defines the immutable maximalist checkpoints for all 7 cards in the Service Rubrics Digest (*General Info*, *Daily/Great Vespers*, *Small/Great Compline*, *Midnight Office*, *Daily/Great Matins [12 Gates]*, *The Hours*, and *Divine Liturgy*).\n2. **Project Facts Registration**:\n   * Registered the standard in [.agents/references/project_facts.md](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/.agents/references/project_facts.md#L31) under the *In-Place References Catalog*.\n3. **Double-Blind TDD Rule**:\n   * Any card marked `PASS` in an audit must be validated by automated unit tests in `tests/` asserting exact field compliance against this standard.\n\n---\n\n### Verification\n* Session compliance passed: `$env:PYTHONPATH=\".\" ; .venv\\Scripts\\pytest tests/test_session_compliance.py --verbose` (**1 passed in 0.36s**).\n\n---\n\n### Ready to Execute\nWith the standard codified, we can begin applying it card-by-card. We will start with **Card 2 (Daily Vespers)** to audit and fix:\n* The stichera ratio hallucination (*6 to the Saint* ➔ *3 Octoechos + 3 Menaion*).\n* Prokeimenon daily tone assignment.\n* Dismissal Troparia chain and Theotokion tone matching.\n\nShall we begin auditing and patching **Card 2 (Daily Vespers)** now?\n\n---\n### Summary of Work\n* Codified the complete 7-card maximalist audit specifications into [.agents/references/canonical_maximalist_digest_standard.md](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/.agents/references/canonical_maximalist_digest_standard.md).\n* Updated [.agents/references/project_facts.md](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/.agents/references/project_facts.md) to register the new standard.\n* Verified that the repository compliance tests remain 100% green."}
